      "text": "Leases every physical host in us-east-1 \u2014 and stores that lease state in DynamoDB. When DNS died, so did every lease check-in.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Leases every physical host in us-east-1 \u2014 and stores that lease state in DynamoDB. When DNS died, so did every lease check-in.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
